            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kelime dağarcığını alfabetik olarak sıralamak için <code>vocabulary.sort()</code> kodunu yaz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"vocabulary = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bridge&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;car&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"vocabulary.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(vocabulary)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"55\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['bridge', 'car', 'key']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>vocabulary.sort()</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
