            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kodda yanlış olan ne?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"active_users = [\" /><text value=\"103\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"140\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"288\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sort(active_users)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>active_users.sort()</code> olmalı</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kodda yanlış olan hiçbir şey yok</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>sort()</code> metodunu yalnızca bir <code>print()</code> ifadesinin içinde kullanabiliriz</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>active_users.sort()</code> olmalı.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İkinci satırın yerine hangisi yazılırsa <code>active_users</code> küçükten büyüğe sıralanır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"active_users = [\" /><text value=\"103\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"140\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"288\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sort(active_users)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>active_users.sort()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>sort(active_users)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>active_users = sort()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>active_users.sort()</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
