          {
            "title": "Question: Sorting strings",
            "id": 82737,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sıralamadan sonra <code>contacts</code> içinde hangi ad ilk sırada yer alacak?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"contacts = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ava&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ana&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bill&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"contacts.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(contacts)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Ana', 'Ava', 'Bill']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Ana\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Ava\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Bill\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"Ana\"</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"Ava\"</code> ve <code>\"Ana\"</code> ikisi de <code>A</code> ile başlıyor. <code>sort()</code> neden <code>\"Ana\"</code>'yı önce sıralıyor?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"contacts = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ava&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ana&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bill&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"contacts.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(contacts)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Ana', 'Ava', 'Bill']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">İkinci harf olan <code>n</code>, <code>v</code>'den önce gelir.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>sort()</code>, adların yazıldığı sırayı tersine çevirir.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>sort()</code>, kısa adları uzun adlardan önce sıralar.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">İkinci harf olan <code>n</code>, <code>v</code>'den önce gelir.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
