            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kodda yanlış olan ne?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cart = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cart.sum())\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>sum(cart)</code> olmalı</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>cart</code> bir liste olmadığı için <code>sum()</code> kullanamayız</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Kodda yanlış olan hiçbir şey yok</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>sum(cart)</code> olmalı.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İkinci satırın yerine hangisi yazılırsa kod sepet toplamı olan <code>87</code>'yi görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cart = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cart.sum())\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>print(sum(cart))</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(max(cart))</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(cart.sum())</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>print(sum(cart))</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
